<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76386" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψων-ιάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furnish with provisions</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. τὰς δυνάμεις</span>
			<i>furnish</i> an army <i>with supplies</i> or <i>pay</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.25.11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				33.22
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be supplied,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PCair.Zen.
				499.42
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				23.8.4
			</span></i>, dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.2.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν ἀλλοτρίων χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				16.22
			</span></i>.</div>
